  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 6802.05 Approval",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6802.05 Approval.\n\n(a) A letter of approval shall be issued from the commissioner to an equipment manufacturer whose preliminary breath test device has met the requirements of Saf-C 6802.01 and Saf-C 6802.02.\n\n(b) Any device previously approved by the commissioner prior to adoption of Saf-C 6800 shall be considered valid for purposes of RSA 265-A:15.\n\n(c) The commissioner shall maintain a list of preliminary breath test devices approved for use in New Hampshire. This list shall be available to anyone upon request.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 6800) #9685, eff 3-23-10; ss by #12518, eff 4-23-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c6800.html"
